| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [Alternative Income Form 1 (DOC)](https://www.cde.ca.gov/fg/aa/lc/documents/sampleform1.doc) | * Collects the **minimum** information required for multiple children. * Parents/guardians calculate their annual income and select among income ranges. | Yes | [Translations to Form 1](http://inet2.cde.ca.gov/cmd/translatedparentaldoc.aspx?docid=8668,%208669,%208674,%208676,%208670-8673,%208536,%208675,%208537) |
| [Alternative Income Form 2 (DOC)](https://www.cde.ca.gov/fg/aa/lc/documents/sampleform2.doc) | * Collects information for multiple children. * Parents/guardians list their income sources and amounts. * LEA determines whether the income falls within specified ranges. | No | [Translations to Form 2](http://inet2.cde.ca.gov/cmd/translatedparentaldoc.aspx?docid=8677-8687) |
| [Alternative Income Form 3 (DOC)](https://www.cde.ca.gov/fg/aa/lc/documents/sampleform3x.doc) | * Collects information for multiple children. * Parents/guardians select among income ranges. * Income ranges presented for various frequencies of payment (weekly, monthly, yearly, etc.). | Yes | [Translations to Form 3](http://inet2.cde.ca.gov/cmd/translatedparentaldoc.aspx?docid=8688-8698) |
| [Alternative Income Form 4 (DOC)](https://www.cde.ca.gov/fg/aa/lc/documents/sampleform4.doc) | * Collects the **minimum** information required for one child. * Parents/guardians provide total income and household size. * LEA determines whether the income falls within specified ranges. | No | [Translations to Form 4](http://inet2.cde.ca.gov/cmd/translatedparentaldoc.aspx?docid=8699-8701,%208740,%208702-8708) |
